{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17778","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 五 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂拱乾坤正，欢心品类同。\n紫烟含北极，玄泽付东风。\n珠缀留晴景，金茎直晓空。\n发生资盛德，交泰让全功。\n间气登三事，祥光啓四聪。\n遐荒似川水，天外亦朝宗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}